 {
  "text": "This week at Max Motors: big prices, small payments! How much is the new family car? Only twenty-eight thousand dollars. How many colors are there? Six. And this week, the first service at our shop is free. Come and see our three hundred cars. Max Motors, open every day from nine to seven.",
