 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, I'm Lucas. I have a small business, and I read a lot about money. Every month, I save ten percent of my profit. How much money do I invest? Not much, but every month. How many stocks do I have? Only five, from big companies. My plan is simple: I don't spend more than my budget, and I invest for the long term.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a8_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
